The images in this folder (the Item icons) are Pokémon game held-item icons. Pokémon and Pokémon
images are © Nintendo, Creatures, GAME FREAK and The Pokémon Company. MyVGC is not affiliated with
them.

The images are not covered by MyVGC's licence, the GNU AGPL v3. No licence to them is granted here.

They come from the item icons in PokeAPI's sprites repository (https://github.com/PokeAPI/sprites),
resized to 48 × 48 and converted to WebP by `pnpm sprites:update`. The pinned commit is in
packages/core/src/sprites.ts and the table of files (ITEM_ICON_FILES) in packages/core/src/icons.ts.
See docs/adr/0032-item-icons-and-type-icons-from-pokeapi.md.
